    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/98b76575beca9b1090696018686b0d22.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/98b76575beca9b1090696018686b0d22.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/98b76575beca9b1090696018686b0d22.mp4?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Break is a fusion of mech and roguelite action. Experience thrilling &quot;thrust&quot; controls that propel you through dynamic dungeons. Collect diverse modular armors to refine your combat style and experiment with endless synergies to craft your ultimate hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bc9b3e2853e2c5155004a08d2941f581.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bc9b3e2853e2c5155004a08d2941f581.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bc9b3e2853e2c5155004a08d2941f581.mp4?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bf70ca4d086dac1877e05d16caf625a5.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bf70ca4d086dac1877e05d16caf625a5.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bf70ca4d086dac1877e05d16caf625a5.mp4?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Features</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/16bf2f56cb7832413ed45f08fb67ec02.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/16bf2f56cb7832413ed45f08fb67ec02.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Combat</strong> - Thrilling thrust controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building</strong> - Collect, upgrade &amp; customize modular body parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Character</strong> - 6 playable characters, each with unique mechanics &amp; skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-stop Action</strong> - Action packed procedural dungeon crawler</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power</strong> - Dynamic powerups &amp; equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergy</strong> - Mix &amp; match characters, modular body parts, powerups &amp; equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/4adce8c3c3f418e8255f9971829624ce.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/4adce8c3c3f418e8255f9971829624ce.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/4adce8c3c3f418e8255f9971829624ce.mp4?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/98b76575beca9b1090696018686b0d22.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/98b76575beca9b1090696018686b0d22.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/98b76575beca9b1090696018686b0d22.mp4?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Break is a fusion of mech and roguelite action. Experience thrilling &quot;thrust&quot; controls that propel you through dynamic dungeons. Collect diverse modular armors to refine your combat style and experiment with endless synergies to craft your ultimate hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bc9b3e2853e2c5155004a08d2941f581.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bc9b3e2853e2c5155004a08d2941f581.webm?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bc9b3e2853e2c5155004a08d2941f581.mp4?t=1737702968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bf70ca4d086dac1877e05d16caf625a5.poster.avif?t=1737702968\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145570/extras/bf70ca4d086dac1877e05d16caf